{"id":95763,"slug":"m-ste-ko-twin-peaks-1990","title":"Městečko Twin Peaks","title_en":"Twin Peaks","year":1990,"rating":87,"votes_count":19356,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"Kdo je vrah a kdo je obětí milostné vášně nebo pouhé náhody? Slavný americký seriál o záhadách a tajemstvích jednoho maloměsta. Malé americké městečko Twin Peaks je na první pohled normální, ale... Po smrti mladé Laury Palmerové přijede její vraždu objasnit agent Cooper. Jeho vyšetřování však vede k temné pravdě. Seriál od kultovního režiséra Davida Lynche.(oficiální text distributora)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lA9CNSdo50iQPZ8A2fyVpMvJZAf.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j5w04XEuFv85N3RIovXBJIHxjSb.jpg","trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Drama","Mysteriózní"],"tags":["láska","vražda","tajemství","záhady","vyšetřování","sny","drogy","únos","milostný trojúhelník","agenti","hory","prostituce","hotel","indiáni","maloměsto","restaurace","šerif","motorky","domácí násilí","FBI","změna identity","jeskyně","vodopád","sovy","portál","agorafobie"],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["David Lynch","Lesli Linka Glatter","Caleb Deschanel","Duwayne Dunham","Tim Hunter","Todd Holland","Tina Rathborne","Graeme Clifford","Stephen Gyllenhaal","Diane Keaton","James Foley","Uli Edel","Jonathan Sanger","Mark Frost"],"actors":["Kyle MacLachlan","Michael Horse","Mädchen Amick","Dana Ashbrook","Richard Beymer","Sherilyn Fenn","Harry Goaz","Michael Ontkean","Lara Flynn Boyle","Warren Frost","Peggy Lipton","James Marshall","Everett McGill","Jack Nance","Kimmy Robertson","Joan Chen","Piper Laurie","Miguel Ferrer","Ray Wise","David Lynch","Wendy Robie","Russ Tamblyn","Eric DaRe","Sheryl Lee","Grace Zabriskie","Don S. Davis","Catherine E. Coulson","Al Strobel","Gary Hershberger","Chris Mulkey","David Patrick Kelly","Ian Buchanan","Chrysta Bell","Mary Jo Deschanel","Robert Forster","Naomi Watts","Kenneth Welsh","Laura Dern","Pierce Gagnon